content:
Build a clear, quiet visual with an Eastern seasonal feel around any theme: let a large area of high-brightness blank space be the main environment, with several horizontal translucent soft color bands extending from the middle of the screen to the bottom, the edges feathered like water vapor, wet staining, and out-of-focus light and shadow. In the depths of the blank space, place a small silhouette symbol refined from the theme semantics, small in scale, close to a slender color band or horizontal line, with a blurry light shadow. Information is concentrated on one side above: the English main title uses oversized, tall, slender modern serif characters; the Chinese theme title is placed below it using more concise and heavy fonts. Colors are derived from the theme's emotions: a very shallow, low-saturation, near-white base tone covers most of the space. Surface treatment maintains a smooth digital ink and thin paper feel.

Theme: {argument name="theme" default="Good morning + Greetings + GOOD MORNING + City + Quotes + Weather + 2026-08-25"}

Each image has a completely different color logic, each country follows its corresponding text logic and favorite color, creating images with Japanese and Korean fresh color schemes.

Subject: {argument name="subject" default="[adult male / female portrait]"}
Interference: {argument name="interference" default="[color split / narrow light beam / horizontal cut / motion veil]"}
Title: {argument name="title" default="[TITLE]"}
Palette: [main neutral tones + one accent color]
Mood: [sharp / cinematic / restrained / experimental]

Create a 9:16 experimental

[Original Poem Line]: {argument name="poem" default="Enter a classic poem line with clear emotion and imagery"}
[Two-character Theme]: {argument name="theme" default="Extract 2 core characters from the poem"}
[Core Emotion]: {argument name="emotion" default="Endless flowing / inextricable / unforgettable / cannot stay / waiting / yearning, etc."}
[Emotional Action]: Flowing away / entangling / remaining / disappearing / fading / drifting away, etc.
[Minor Subject]: Water traces / threads / old windows / flower petals / lanterns / boats / letters, etc.

Create a bold editorial campaign poster where oversized typography actively shapes the visual concept instead of simply sitting in the background.

Brand: {argument name="brand name" default="[BRAND NAME]"}
Product / Campaign: {argument name="campaign" default="[PRODUCT OR CAMPAIGN]"}
Main Word: {argument name="word" default="[SHORT WORD]"}
Subject / Product: [PERSON / PRODUCT]

{
  "prompt_template": {
    "subject": "{argument name="subject" default="Person Name/Uploaded Image"}",
    "style": "hyperrealistic studio portrait photograph, cinematic dual-tone lighting",
    "composition": {
      "framing": "chest-up close crop portrait",
      "position": "perfectly centered, symmetrical",
      "orientation": "vertical, portrait aspect ratio 4:5",
      "gaze": "direct eye contact with camera, head facing forward, chin level"
    },
    "expression": {
      "mood": "calm, neutral, slightly serious",
      "mouth": "closed, relaxed lips",
      "eyes": "sharp, alert, direct"
    },
    "wardrobe": {
      "clothing": "plain oversized white crewneck t-shirt or sweatshirt",
      "details": "no logos, no patterns, relaxed loose fit, shoulders fully visible",
      "color": "pure white, slightly glowing under fill light"
    },
    "lighting": {
      "setup": "dual-tone split lighting",
      "key_light": "warm amber/orange rim light from camera-left, raking across one side of face, neck and shoulder",
      "fill_light": "cool blue ambient light filling the rest of the face and body",
      "background_light": "soft glow gradient matching blue ambient tone",
      "contrast": "high contrast between warm highlight and cool shadow zones",
      "quality": "soft studio diffusion with a crisp rim highlight, no harsh shadows on facial features"
    },
    "background": {
      "type": "seamless studio backdrop",
      "color_gradient": "deep navy blue to teal, darker at edges",
      "vignette": "subtle darkening toward corners",
      "texture": "smooth, no props, no patterns"
    },
    "camera_specs": {
      "lens": "85mm equivalent portrait lens",
      "aperture": "shallow depth of field, f/2.8 look",
      "focus": "tack sharp on eyes and facial features",
      "sensor_feel": "medium format digital, ultra high resolution, 8k detail"
    },
    "skin_and_hair_detail": {
      "skin": "natural realistic texture, visible pores, subtle sheen from lighting, no over-smoothing or plastic look",
      "hair": "natural texture and volume matching subject's real hairstyle, individual strands visible under rim light"
    },
    "color_grade": "cinematic teal and orange color grade, warm highlights vs cool shadows, filmic contrast",
    "post_processing": "professional retouch level, subtle skin evenness, retain natural imperfections, no beautify filter, no plastic AI look",
    "negative_prompt": "no text, no watermark, no extra objects, no inset image, no reference photo overlay, no multiple people, no distorted face, no blurry eyes, no cartoon or illustration style, no harsh unnatural shadows",
    "output_settings": {
      "resolution": "high resolution, ultra detailed 8k",
      "aspect_ratio": "4:5 portrait",
      "realism_level": "photorealistic, indistinguishable from a real studio photograph"
    }
  }
}

{ 
  "prompt_type": "ultra_realistic_candid_portrait", 
  "subject": { 
    "identity": "{argument name="identity" default="Uploaded Image"}", 
    "identity_note": "Preserve the exact facial identity, hairstyle, beard, and overall appearance of {argument name="person name" default="subject"} as accurately as possible", 
    "pose": "{argument name="pose" default="seated indoors, relaxed and natural body language"}", 
    "gaze": "looking slightly off to the side, calm and introspective expression", 
    "eyewear": "dark sunglasses" 
  }, 
  "attire": { 
    "top": "loose-fitting white linen shirt", 
    "collar": "open collar, unbuttoned at the top", 
    "sleeves": "long sleeves, slightly rolled or rolled", 
    "fit": "casual, breathable, effortless drape" 
  }, 
  "composition": { 
    "shot_type": "medium close-up", 
    "angle": "three-quarter side profile", 
    "framing": "partially obscured by soft blurred foreground elements such as leaves and a doorway edge, giving depth and a candid observational feel", 
    "aspect_ratio": "vertical 3:4" 
  }, 
  "lighting": { 
    "source": "warm late-afternoon sunlight entering from the side", 
    "effect": "soft highlights across the face and shirt, deep cinematic shadows", 
    "background": "dark, elegant, softly out of focus interior" 
  }, 
  "photographic_style": { 
    "depth_of_field": "shallow with creamy bokeh", 
    "texture": "realistic skin detail, natural facial hair rendering", 
    "grain": "subtle film grain", 
    "color_grade": "muted, warm tones", 
    "genre": "premium editorial lifestyle photography", 
    "lens_simulation": "85mm lens, f/1.8 aperture", 
    "realism_level": "highly detailed, photorealistic" 
  }, 
  "output_requirements": { 
    "consistency": "generate the same final image style, mood, lighting, framing, and attire regardless of who the person is", 
    "variable_input": "only the person's name changes; all other elements remain fixed" 
  } 
}

@Create Image
Step 1: Search for the 10 most classic stills from the movie "{argument name="movie name" default="Kikujiro's Summer"}". Use each still as a reference image.
Step 2: Replace the protagonists with {argument name="new characters" default="Zhang Fei and Zhuge Liang"}. Maintain the characters' emotions, film grain, and color texture. Keep the original composition and creative characteristics. Output each image as if it were an original film still.
